<div class="help-page">
  <header class="help-intro"><p class="eyebrow">How adoption works</p><h1>A thoughtful beginning.</h1><p>From the first hello to bringing your puppy home, here’s what to expect along the way.</p></header>
  <div class="help-layout">
    <aside class="help-aside"><h2>Already applied?</h2><p>Use your tracking code to see where your application stands.</p><a class="text-link" href="/track">My application <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
    <div>
      <ol class="adoption-guide">
        <li><span class="guide-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h2>Meet your companion</h2><p>Explore the available puppies and take a closer look at their photos, personality, and profile details. Take your time finding a puppy you would like to get to know.</p><a class="text-link" href="/puppies">Meet our puppies <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></li>
        <li><span class="guide-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h2>Tell us about your home</h2><p>Apply from the puppy’s profile and share a little about your family and daily life. After submitting, save your private tracking code so you can check your progress.</p></div></li>
